{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And they shall become blood on the dry land.</b> The repetition of והיו ... והיו — 'and they shall be ... and they shall be' — twice comes to teach that after they see the water on the dry land and the matter becomes clear to the eyes of all that it is water, then it will turn into blood; and this is the sense of והיו לדם."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:56:00.488141873Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}